WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:03.505
Choose a basket. The connected AI Labs basket shows its index in points. Predict opens a test-network Window; Cover needs two member tokens held by the viewer; Hold starts a separate desk draft.

2
00:00:03.505 --> 00:00:08.769
Open the live Window. Predict opens the AI Labs 24/7 Window. Read the opening line, remaining time and price source before choosing a side.

3
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:11.188
Choose Down. Down is selected in the ticket. This is only a choice on the page; no order has been sent.

4
00:00:11.188 --> 00:00:16.175
Preview a quote. Enter a stake of 5 and compare current cost, return and maximum loss. The recording stops before Buy and before any signature.
